description: >
  The doc comment for ClientSessionId reads: "Shared identifier for one active
  thin-client session." It mentions the recovery message references a "stable
  non-empty" value but nowhere describes the format or structure (e.g. opaque
  string, UUID, base64, max length). A reader of the public API cannot infer
  the acceptable format from the comment alone.

