fix_guidance: >
  Extend the doc comment on `ClientSessionId` in crates/atm-core/src/types.rs
  to describe the format: opaque non-empty, non-blank UTF-8 string with no
  internal whitespace constraints beyond the blank check. Include an example
  of a typical session id (e.g. a UUID or similar stable token).

